& [Need]
  + A5 completes signed decision correspondence but still lacks a bounded way to compare post-decision supplied workspace conditions to the exact plan
  + legacy decision and plan pin different historical carrier commits; treating either as latest host state would misrepresent the signed inputs
& [Choice]
  + keep both old pins and compare a separate explicit expected carrier with supplied observation values; mark expectation authority and signed A6 coverage false
  + replay and nest the entire A5 receipt and replay exact inherited plan so observed match cannot erase reject adverse status or historical lineage
  + ten fixed comparison flags and ordered reasons make adverse facts auditable rather than discarding all nonmatching inputs as malformed
  + exact26-file independent evidence and24-input CLI prove bounded replay without a collector or writer
& [AlternativesPruned]
  + discard latest-HEAD substitution old-capacity replacement flexible unrelated plan lossy A5 summary normalized remote alias trusted Boolean success flag opaque diagnostic-only mismatch and ungoverned host acquisition
& [Support]
  + source source_documents/2026-09-03_b1_expected_observation_correspondence_p0/Derived_B1_Expected_Observation_Correspondence_P0_Source.sop; constraints narrative/research/Cantor_B1_Expected_Observation_Correspondence_P0_Constraint_Ledger_2026-09-03.sop; constructive/adversarial review narrative/research/Cantor_B1_Expected_Observation_Correspondence_P0_Dual_Hemisphere_Review_2026-09-03.sop; ordered data narrative/research/Cantor_B1_Expected_Observation_Correspondence_P0_Data_Design_2026-09-03.sop; all33 requirements map to explicit evidence obligations
